    "_X5_note": "Demo/test is the refining fire. It takes claims and proves them, takes assumptions and tests them. The only form where tests are the main content, not a supporting section.",
    "_X5_scripture": "Proverbs 27:21 — As the fining pot for silver, and the furnace for gold; so is a man to his praise."
